{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"So how did you two meet by the way, I hope I'm not being intrusive\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T11:52:30.758000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866286308459544606","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Oh, not at all. We just met in the docks about a week ago, when the curfews started.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T11:53:23.235000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866286528563904572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'He halp. Which--- who--- when Coocoo. That day.'","created_at":"2021-07-18T11:54:34.367000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866286826914054204","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Oh yeah, I think it was the same day we first met too. Trouble at the docks, Bo Harkness got captured, you went to help?\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T11:55:30.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866287063334912010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"I believe it was the frenchman not Bo, who I ... helped\" Johnathan shudders \"Funny, that feels like a different lifetime even though it wasn't a week ago\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T11:57:03.956000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866287454334746644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
