{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"Roy laughs awkwardly. \"Well... you are not wrong.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T11:57:41.705000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866287612666314772","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"(he knows what I mean)\nshe looks at Roy with a sort of '...well technically...' sort of look.","created_at":"2021-07-18T11:57:47.399000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866287636547895316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"I apologise for any comments I may have made in defense of the guards. If anything they have shown me how great a fool I was\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T11:59:59.653000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866288191263080448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'A-bell to ac-cept bean wring? Wrong? Not full.'","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:00:41.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866288368027435009","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"You're a good man, Johnathan. Anyone would want to avoid the conflict, but it seems that it was just inevitable. You may fly the same flag for your homeland, but I don't see you as one of the destroyers of this city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:03:07.052000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866288977270931456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"I'm afraid that I have grown too much shame to fly the Jack anymore. I have grown to think that this land and that flag should never see each other again. In anycase this is my homeland. England was my father's land. Where is you're homeland Roy?\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:06:11.719000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866289751819681814","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Deeper into the old world's mainland, not far off the Danube.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:09:49.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866290664613085225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Though honestly, we rarely look that far out, back there. In the small towns where everyone's part of the Swarm, that's all the identity we need.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:10:42.292000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866290886685884446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
