{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Right there in the middle of Europe, at a bigger scale everyone's fighting everyone, really. And with all the gods getting involved, that doesn't make things any better. So here I am, on a mission to find a place our Swarm could move to when we can no longer protect ourselves.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:13:32.537000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866291600744120341","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Well, vaguely on a mission, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:13:50.782000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866291677270638602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"An honorable mission, no matter how vague\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:14:27.442000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866291831033561128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"It's not the vagueness of the mission as much as my part in it. Quite a few things can be guessed from the fact that I was sent here alone.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:15:25.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866292073749676053","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
