{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Thank you. Though the fate of the Swarm would be something for the swarm to deal with. After all, I did try seeing if people in the city would be interested in joining the Swarm.\"\n\n\"Of course as you can imagine, the more I would go into details about being part of a swarm, the less appealing it sounds to those from outside it. So that is put on hold now, until the city is safe.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T12:23:18.096000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866294056757100555","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
